  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Saleem Ahmad vs State Of U.P. And 5 Others on 25 June, 2021 Bench: Manoj Misra, Anil Kumar Ojha High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 40 Case :- Writ - C No. - 12032 of 2021 Petitioner :- Saleem Ahmad",
    "facts": "The petitioner had a license for a meat shop under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, which was valid up to 5th March, 2021. The case of the petitioner is that since the proceeding was not brought to its logical conclusion and in the meantime the license of the petitioner expired, he applied for issuance of 'No Objection Saleem Ahmad vs State Of U.P. And 5 Others on 25 June, 2021 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/65077326/ 1 Certificate' from the police station concerned to enable him to seek for renewal of the license. The prayer in this petition is that the respondents be directed to grant 'No Objection Certificate' and restore the meat shop license already granted to the petitioner.",
